<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">

  <head>
    <title>登錄頁面</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
    <meta name="generator" content="GrapesJS Studio">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/home.css" />
    <script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/9.22.2/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
    <script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/9.22.2/firebase-auth-compat.js"></script>
    <script>
      window.FIREBASE_CONFIG = {
        apiKey: '<%= firebaseConfig.apiKey %>',
        authDomain: '<%= firebaseConfig.authDomain %>',
        projectId: '<%= firebaseConfig.projectId %>',
        appId: '<%= firebaseConfig.appId %>',
        messagingSenderId: '<%= firebaseConfig.messagingSenderId %>',
        measurementId: '<%= firebaseConfig.measurementId %>'
      };
    </script>
    <script src="/main.js" defer></script>
  </head>

  <body class="gjs-t-body font-body cls-lq8aly">
    <main class="login-page" id="ielgh">
      <section class="login-section" id="iqs15">
        <div class="login-layout" id="iy5qg">
          <div class="login-form-panel" id="inkyo">
            <div class="form-header" id="ilm4i">
              <h2 class="gjs-t-h2 font-heading form-title" id="i6m4q">登入系統</h2>
              <p class="form-subtitle" id="i8qqi">
                您可以使用帳號密碼登入，或使用 Google 帳號進行登入。系統會依據授權判斷是否具有使用權限。
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="login-form" id="iq4ck">
              <form id="login-form" class="login-credentials-form">
                <div class="input-wrapper">
                  <label for="email">電子郵件</label>
                  <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="請輸入電子郵件" required />
                </div>
                <div class="input-wrapper">
                  <label for="password">密碼</label>
                  <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="請輸入密碼" required />
                </div>
                <div class="login-options">
                  <label class="remember-label">
                    <input type="checkbox" id="rememberMe" /> 記住我
                  </label>
                  <a href="#" id="forgot-password-link">忘記密碼？</a>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="gjs-t-button submit-button" id="login-submit-button">
                  使用帳密登入
                </button>
              </form>

              <div class="separator">或</div>

              <button type="button" class="gjs-t-button submit-button" id="google-signin-button">
                使用 Google 帳號登入
              </button>
              <p class="login-note" id="login-note">若帳號尚未授權，請聯絡管理員建立 Firestore 使用者資料。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <footer class="footer" id="iirls">
        <div class="footer-container" id="iaxy1">
          <p class="company-name" id="ieh9o">問題回報：s122222@yfms.tyc.edu.tw</p>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>

</html>
